---
// Skills section
---

<section id="skills" class="skills">
  <div class="skills-container">
    <h2>Skills & Expertise</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Technical capabilities across AI, cloud, and full-stack development</p>

    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-category">
        <h3>AI & Machine Learning</h3>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>LLMs & Generative AI</li>
          <li>Prompt Engineering & Agents</li>
          <li>PyTorch, TensorFlow, Keras</li>
          <li>NLP & Computer Vision</li>
          <li>Model Development & Evaluation</li>
          <li>Production ML Systems</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-category">
        <h3>Cloud & MLOps Infrastructure</h3>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>Azure (DataFactory, AutoML, Databricks)</li>
          <li>Docker & Container Orchestration</li>
          <li>CI/CD Pipelines & Automation</li>
          <li>MLFlow, DVC Model Management</li>
          <li>Azure ML Pipelines</li>
          <li>Infrastructure Optimization & Cost Reduction</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-category">
        <h3>Backend & Data Engineering</h3>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>Python, C++, C#, JavaScript, TypeScript</li>
          <li>FastAPI, Flask, .NET</li>
          <li>PostgreSQL & Database Design</li>
          <li>REST APIs & Secure Workflows</li>
          <li>Data Pipelines & ETL</li>
          <li>PySpark & Large-Scale Data Processing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-category">
        <h3>Advanced AI Architectures</h3>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)</li>
          <li>Vector Databases & Embeddings</li>
          <li>Multi-Agent Systems</li>
          <li>Fine-tuning & Small Language Models</li>
          <li>Structured Output & Intent Detection</li>
          <li>Semantic Kernel & LLM Orchestration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-category">
        <h3>Data Analysis & Visualization</h3>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>PowerBI & Analytics Dashboards</li>
          <li>Pandas, NumPy, SciPy</li>
          <li>Anomaly Detection & Monitoring</li>
          <li>SQL Analytics & Query Optimization</li>
          <li>Statistical Analysis</li>
          <li>R & Advanced Data Science</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skill-category">
        <h3>Development Tools & Practices</h3>
        <ul class="skill-list">
          <li>Git, GitHub, GitLab, Azure DevOps</li>
          <li>Linux & System Administration</li>
          <li>CUDA & GPU Computing</li>
          <li>LaTeX, Technical Documentation</li>
          <li>Postman & API Testing</li>
          <li>OpenCV & Image Processing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .skills {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    background: white;
  }

  .skills-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .skills h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .skill-category {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #64d5ff;
  }

  .skill-category h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    color: #0f0f1e;
  }

  .skill-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .skill-list li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    color: #666;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .skill-list li:before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #64d5ff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .skills {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .skills h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
